helm (4.3.1-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Repack the upstream 4.3.1 release binary. The series version suffix is
    added at build time by .forgejo/registry-upload and never committed.
  * Upstream maintains 3.x and 4.x in parallel, 3.22.1 and 4.3.1 both being
    current releases, so this is a deliberate move onto the 4.x line rather
    than a routine catch-up. Helm 4 is a major release, so chart workflows
    and scripts written against helm 3 are worth a look before the fleet
    takes the upgrade.
  * No advisories either way: trivy reports none against the Go modules
    built into 3.22.1, and none against 4.3.1.

